[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a ramp.</p><p>1. Undo the fixing nuts (1a) and disconnect the electrical cables (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004210\">See A001 BATTERY</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Loosen the nut (2a) and disconnect the negative battery terminal (2b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004210\">See A001 BATTERY</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002973.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Undo the fixing bolt (1a) and disconnect the earth lead (1b) from the bodyshell.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Battery earth</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004375\">See C1 BATTERY EARTH ( BATTERY NEGATIVE )</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002974.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Undo the fixing bolt (1a) and disconnect the earth lead (1b) from the bell housing.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Earth on engine</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004409\">See C040 ENGINE EARTH</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002975.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Remove the battery earth lead.</p>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check the condition of the earth lead.</p><p>If necessary, conduct a continuity test on the lead.</p><p>Position the battery earth lead and tighten the bolt fixing the lead to the bell housing to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000656.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>BATTERY EARTH LEAD</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(bell housing) 2.4</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Tighten the bolt fixing the battery earth lead to the bodyshell to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000656.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>BATTERY EARTH LEAD</p></td><td><p>M10</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(bodyshell) 5.6</p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Connect the electrical cables (1a) and tighten the fixing nuts (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004210\">See A001 BATTERY</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Connect the negative battery terminal (2a) and tighten the nut (2b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004210\">See A001 BATTERY</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002976.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"]]